  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The very runes of the Eye of Magnus descend to attack Yuri.
  - A separate set of runes descend that split.
  - The splitting runes descend in groups of two.
  - A larger rune projects power downward onto Yuri, forcing her to the ground and
    flinging splitting runes from the sides.
  - <font=glitchfont>up up down down left right left right (no B A Start)</font>
  - More of the larger runes get projected, firing out waves of pure energy.
  - Large runes begins circling Yuri, firing out the occasional blue wave of energy.
  - More large runes begin circling Yuri, firing out the occasional orange wave of
    energy.
  - Ancano forces out as much power as he can, unleashing every type of large rune.
  - As a result of the pressure Ancano just forced on the Eye, something bad happens.
  - Ancano has ran out of the power granted by the Eye of Magnus. He is now forced
    to use his own magic, flinging fireballs at Yuri.
  randomAttacks:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 925c70fdaa26d464b8f0ab97620eb9ee, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2554851ad7a7f14291f9ed278585dbf, type: 2}
