  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b2e0651f7b7ae549876522d820a34dc, type: 2}
  randomFlavorTexts:
  - Ancano flings down fire from above. Again.
  - Ancano desperately releases as many fireballs as he can.
  - Ancano flings pockets of frost at Yuri's sides.
  - Ancano unleashes a torrent of cold.
  - Ancano flings fireballs and fires lightning.
  - Ancano releases lightning from his fingertips.
  maxHealth: 200
