  enemyPrefab: {fileID: 1745643679205403353, guid: 3474d1de875dc0a408fabd5060391b0e, type: 3}
  defeatText: The weakened Ancano falls to the combined efforts of Yuri and Mirabelle.
  nameText: Ancano
  blurbText: You ever notice that the only time characters get injured outside of
    combat is when there's a healer in the group? Weird!
